;   12: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひよく, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しのざき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ごうおん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぬ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=いと, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=9858, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=8995, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―It must be past 3 p.m. by now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\駅見下ろし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I've been watching Arata Station from up in a tree the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Any time now, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto could show up.<PG>
The rain keeps falling, same as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Earlier I thought the thunder had died down, but now it's a thunderstorm again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No sign of it ever letting up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't thunderclouds usually clear up after a while?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rain keeps falling, as if time has stopped in this one place alone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Then I see a one-car train in the distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> should be on this train or the next one, the 5 p.m. arrival.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\荒田駅昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There they are...!
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It really, really is <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, I have to get down this tree, fast...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to tell them what's going on in the settlement right now, and once we've talked, get them out of here right away...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\人をつかむ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, someone has me by the scruff of the neck.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should have been alone up this tall tree the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only one who could do this is <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she trying to keep me from meeting <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto this time...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shoot a sharp <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE> behind me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, long time no see!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
The one standing there was unmistakably <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been 2 years since we last met, but apart from maybe being a little taller, she hasn't changed as much as I'd expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, just like <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, she crept up behind me without giving off any presence at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Up a tree, no less!<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Why are </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> here...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Long story, but I was watching Toyotake Station, and there was this pair of strangers heading for Arata Station. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So I came on ahead of them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> is watching Toyotake Station, <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyone heading to Arata Station has to pass through Toyotake Station, so it's easy to know ahead of time who's coming.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, why are you here? Is the mountain seclusion over?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the look of it, she doesn't know I met <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd better avoid bringing up the settlement's destruction as much as I can.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, things will probably just get complicated again...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh? Oh, y-yeah, that's right, the mountain seclusion's over. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So I was just looking at the view from up here, first time in ages."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hmm... In all this rain, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> stares at me suspiciously.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"But your clothes are new, so you went back to the settlement once, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Didn't you meet anyone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh no. Sure enough, the way I'm dressed doesn't look like I came here straight from the mountain seclusion.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"U-um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I stopped by the settlement for a bit and changed, but there was nobody around... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Where'd everybody go... hahaha..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I look away and try a wry smile, but the look in <STYLE ID="5">Kana's</STYLE> eyes doesn't change.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Didn't you meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sharp gleam in <STYLE ID="5">Kana's</STYLE> eyes, as if it sees through everything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, she openly changes her expression and <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にら">glares</STYLE> at me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Come to think of it, I did meet her... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Yeah, just for a bit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">You met her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>With that, <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> took up a knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\E3839BE383A9E383BC3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n100\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Why pull out a weapon at a time like this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does this mean she's hostile toward me after all...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you do know your position, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　If you make me mad, you'll fall from up here and die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　No, wait... even if by some chance you don't die... I'll finish you off anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is <STYLE ID="5">this one</STYLE> talking about...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't said anything to make <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> mad!<PG>
I glance down out of the corner of my eye―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田駅外ノーマル.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> are coming out of Arata Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They look a little thrown by the muddy, unpaved road.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\枝.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you curious about those people?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Didn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> tell you? Bad people are coming to the settlement today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"W-wait a sec..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"So we don't have to go easy on anyone who comes to the settlement, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Stop it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... Don't lay a hand on those two...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? So those two are people you know, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Hmm... Maybe they came here to see you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\春花ナイフ突きつけられる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> holds two knives to my throat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I try anything funny at all, all my blood will drain out in 5 seconds.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, hey, maybe... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, did you call those two here? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you the thing that's going to destroy the settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"N-no...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　But Lady Verde said to kill the three outsiders..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lady Verde!? Does she mean that mummy...?<PG>
So the one who made the prophecy that the settlement would perish wasn't <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE>, but Verde...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that mummy does have something to do with this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must both have gone strange because of that mummy...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\枝.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> put the knives back in their sheaths.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
