{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, if you don't know those two, that's fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you keep watch on those two. I'm gonna go tell everyone right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">As long as you keep them out of the settlement, that's all you have to do!"</STYLE>
