{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly back to the innocent face I know, <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> took off toward the settlement like a flying squirrel.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I sit straddling a thick branch and lean my back against the trunk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My legs have no strength in them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
