{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them let go of their umbrellas and ran over to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And both of them throw their arms around me at once.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm so glad!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I missed you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel like I've finally met someone I know.<PG>
But the next moment, an unwanted doubt wells up: are <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> really the two I know?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe these two will start talking about Verde and destruction too, like <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and the others.
