<BR>
I couldn't hug back the two of them clinging to me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"You two... are you really </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course we are! Let's go back to Motoki-cho together. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's... nothing to be scared of anymore...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> must have been through a hard time here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Come on, let's let her rest on a bench at the station."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them are worried about me...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> didn't do anything like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, can you walk? Want me to carry you on my back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, please lean on us. You must be tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uuuh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Uuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As a <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おえつ">sob</STYLE> escaped me, all the strength drained right out of my body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put my whole weight on the two of them, and they hold me up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd finally met people I could feel safe with, and I found rest for the first time in 2 years.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it was hard, wasn't it? It's okay now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we're right here with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The things they say haven't changed from 2 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Really, I'd like to stay like this and lose myself in the feeling, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
I have to explain the situation to the two of them as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gather the strength that drained away into my legs and get up on my own.<PG>
