<STYLE ID="6">But right now, something terrible's happening in the Arata settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"O-okay! Then why don't we take the train somewhere safe right away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's a good idea! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Now that we've found you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, there's no need to go to the Arata settlement at all!"</STYLE>
