<STYLE ID="1">"What are you saying, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! As long as you come back safe, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that's all that matters!"</STYLE>
