<STYLE ID="2">"The Arata settlement―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">or more precisely, the Arata district, which belongs to no city, town or village: what's known as 'land with undetermined boundaries.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, for convenience's sake, maps seem to show it as being inside Iizawa Prefecture. </STYLE>
