<STYLE ID="2">And it's the middle of nowhere, where hardly anyone ever sets foot."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, I won't deny it's the middle of nowhere..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But the Arata district is a vast area, and apparently there are parts that still haven't been explored."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"There are a lot of mountains, sure, and where I did my mountain seclusion, there was nothing but mountains..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"In other words, the Arata settlement is only a tiny part of the whole Arata district. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Put the other way around, you could say most of it is a realm of mystery."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"'Mystery' is kind of an overstatement..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's no overstatement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　The soil around the Arata settlement is quite </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ひよく">fertile</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and apparently there are lots of big, unusual animals."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, that rings a bell. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Still, you really did your homework. How'd you find all this out?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I looked things up at libraries and asked university professors. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Information like this isn't on the internet, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"University professors?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I got to talk with professors all over the country who are experts in cultural anthropology and biology. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">My name seems to be fairly well known, so if I said I was interested in their field, most professors would meet with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh, so the 'genius girl' title really does carry weight..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But it wasn't all such peaceful stories. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">For all that the land is so </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ひよく">fertile</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and full of unusual plants and animals, almost nothing is known about what they really are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you know why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh? Why...? It's just that nobody's looked into it, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then why do you think nobody's looked into it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　A place this worth studying, do you think researchers would just leave it alone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Jeez, enough with the quiz... Just tell me already."</STYLE><PG>
This side of <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> hasn't changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Talking in quiz form probably helps me understand better, but this time of all times, there's no room to take it slow.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\電車待機.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"All right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The truth is... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the Japanese government bans entry into the Arata district to everyone but its residents."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
―From there, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> began to talk about Droga.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Droga hasn't been made public, but apparently among historians and cultural anthropologists, there are rumors like that about the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this research had always been treated as taboo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if Droga were misused, it could upset the balance of the world.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\電車待機.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"And then, about the culture of the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The Arata settlement's shinigami and witches I'll skip, since I think you know about those, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you know about the religion unique to the Arata settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"You don't mean the shinigami and witch stuff?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No. Of course that's related too, but I mean what lies underneath it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Could it be... Verde?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">In the Arata settlement, Japan and the West mixed into a unique culture that has lasted to the present day. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Well, let's provisionally call it the Verde faith. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The chief deity of the Verde faith is the Goddess Verde―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">said to be a girl who died about 450 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey now... How do you know so much...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Even I only heard the name Verde for the first time today..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Actually, until about 70 years ago, there was a religion practiced mainly around Megasawa City."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"A religion in Megasawa City...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　You don't mean, um, what was it... the Holy Cerejeira Church?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so you knew about it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah, that's the thing that got me bullied in Megasawa City. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Back in elementary school, I didn't really know much about that religion. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">There was a kid in my class from a Holy Cerejeira Church family, and that kid was getting bullied. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">When I stood up for that kid..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that's how, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you became the target of the bullying... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Actually, that Holy Cerejeira Church originated in the Arata settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The Holy Cerejeira Church was founded in Megasawa City several hundred years ago by people who left the Arata settlement, and it revered Droga as a sacred treasure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But in the modern era, there was a movement to study Droga scientifically. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The one researching Droga in that religious group was a person named Hajime </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="しのざき">Shinozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But the experiments seem to have been pretty inhumane, and about 70 years ago the Holy Cerejeira Church collapsed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Because of that, former believers turned hostile toward the Holy Cerejeira Church instead, and families that still follow it even today seem to have a hard time of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The classmate you helped, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, was probably one of them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Shinozaki died some 50 years ago already, but apparently he tried as hard as he could to leave his research to later generations. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thanks to that, there were still a few people who remembered some of his findings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That person is very old too and only remembers fragments, but I was able to meet with them and hear what they had to say."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But this Hajime </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="しのざき">Shinozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> apparently changed his name."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What's that about?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"They carried out inhumane experiments again and again, and there's a list of the researchers. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If you're someone whose name is on that list..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ah, then life gets hard in a lot of ways."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So who Hajime Shinozaki really was has stayed unknown all along. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The researchers of that time are all dead, so even the person I met never knew Hajime Shinozaki directly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Getting back to the subject, the Goddess Verde died at 14. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And this is what's said: </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\翠眼呪殺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">'The Green-Eye Curse-Killing has been severed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">To the girl who saved Arata with her life we give a holy name, and worship her as a goddess.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"This is starting to sound... kind of occult... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">What even is a Green-Eye Curse-Killing...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"In the Arata settlement, very rarely, a girl is apparently born with just one green eye. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When such a girl reached puberty, it seems she would try to kill every last person in the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Kill every last person...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> has just one green eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE>... would kill every last person in the settlement...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The Goddess Verde succeeded, by some means, in severing the Green-Eye Curse-Killing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But it seems it was an act that cost her her life. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ever since, Verde has been worshipped as a god. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Apparently even the Westerners gradually came to accept Verde, who saved the settlement, as a god."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"So that's why they made Verde into a mummy? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Why would anyone turn her into a mummy...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's a common story with religions: they probably needed some kind of idol. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">They had the remains of the goddess who saved the settlement right in front of them, so mummifying her and worshipping that isn't, well, all that unnatural."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. If <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> analysis is right, it ties in with the 'god to pray to' that <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> talked about earlier.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"So, do you know why everyone's gone strange?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I can't really say anything about that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But the basic principle of Droga is something like a stimulant drug. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If Droga is what made everyone go strange, I can't say for certain there's no connection."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Isn't that overthinking it a bit...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It is overthinking it, sure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But as long as what's happening now is divorced from reality, we need guesses that are divorced from reality too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\電車待機.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, who'd kept quiet until now, cut into the conversation.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't really get what you're talking about, but... I still think we should go home together, right now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I hate the idea of you being somewhere with stimulants and stuff like that going around, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But still... just abandoning everyone like this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">They're definitely not in their right minds, so I want to get everyone back to normal."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I agree with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. We should call the police first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> are against getting any more involved in what's going on in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure, I'm scared of sticking my nose in any further too, but...<PG>
No, I'd better listen to what the two of them say here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They should be able to think about this more calmly and objectively than me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right. Let's do that. If we say the people of the settlement have vanished, the police should take action."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, that's the best way! You've got me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> right here with you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh, that reminds me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When is this train going to leave? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Its departure time should have passed ages ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨屋内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
Now that she mentions it, it's been at least 10 minutes since we got on the train.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just 10 minutes. More than 30 have passed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet there's no sign at all of it leaving.<PG>
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
before I knew it, I'd been swallowed by a strange discomfort that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto probably can't sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What this discomfort really is―
{PAUSE ""}
a foul smell.
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A faint stench an ordinary person wouldn't notice is drifting all the way in here, mixed with the nasty damp of the rain.<PG>
There's no mistaking this smell―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
