{MESON "500"}
I go up to the driver's cab and try to look inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a blind blocks the driver's cab, and I can't see what's going on inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I jump out of the train and <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="のぞ">peer</STYLE> into it through the glass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The heavy rain has fogged the windows, and it's dim to begin with, so with the light scattering off the water drops, it's hard to see inside.<PG>
But I can tell something red is splattered in there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, the stench is drifting out from in there.<PG>
I get back on the train and head for the driver's cab.
